  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Heavenly Court still needs six hours to restore fate Gu. Duke Long’s injuries from Eastern Sea’s rank eight Gu Immortals have not fully healed. He tells Fairy Zi Wei the injuries do not matter: he is about to die anyway, and he has this killer move. After Bing Sai Chuan’s prepared time path strike fails to hold him, Duke Long asks how Bing Sai Chuan could comprehend the profundity of the move, then puts his focus back on Calamity Luck Altar.",
      "chapters": [
        1713
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "gu_fate_gu",
        "char_duke_long",
        "reg_eastern_sea",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "char_fairy_zi_wei",
        "char_bing_sai_chuan",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long activates the immortal killer move Heavenly Dragon’s Last Stand. The lower his lifespan, the greater the amplification, in all aspects. His battle strength rises every second. His vitality shrinks while his aura continues to grow. This is his final battle, and at the last moments of his life he erupts with unprecedented brilliance.",
      "chapters": [
        1721
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "immortal-activation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He uses the immortal killer move again against Seven Extreme Desolation. After using it, his lifespan can only decrease and cannot be increased, while his battle strength keeps rising as time passes. In a short period his battle strength soars again. Purple-gold dragon-shaped qi erupts, and Seven Extreme Desolation cannot react before a boundless force sends the giant flying into the qi wall.",
      "chapters": [
        1732
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-wall-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
